flowchart TD
  A{Stakeholder needs a new environment or model?} -->|No| B[Keep current phase]
  A -->|Yes| C{Requirements have metric and owner?}
  C -->|No| D[Return to discovery]
  C -->|Yes| E{Model has a retirement notice?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Test named replacement before date]
  E -->|No| G{Separate environment needed?}
  F --> G
  G -->|Yes| H[Create workspace with its own limits]
  G -->|No| I[Proceed through the gates]
